  "releaseNotes": "v0.18.0: Inline Mermaid and SVG rendering — fenced blocks with lang=mermaid render via bundled mermaid.min.js (UMD v10) themed to the chat surface; lang=svg renders directly with script tags stripped. Diagram action header (Copy SVG / Save as SVG / Save as PNG) shared with tool-result inline images, replacing the modal viewer. Compose-bar reuse for editing prior user messages. Fix tool-result image header regression and transparent tooltip background. Rebuild against AssistStudio.Core 0.18.0 (.Core namespace segment) and Ai.Providers 0.6.0.",
